{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由TVB大型唱跳節目《魔音女團》打造的全新女團MYNT今日（19日）推出首支MV，成員莊子璇（Hilary）竟被爆出秘密身份！原來MV中其中一套性感戰衣竟是她親手設計，大玩黑白銀色調，展現驚人時尚觸覺，究竟這位港姐冠軍為何突然跨界做設計師？</p><p>MV性感戰衣曝光 莊子璇設計獲採用</p><p>在MYNT首支歌曲《Turn My Magic On》的MV中，六位成員以多套性感戰衣亮相，包括Tube Top Look、背心Look及短裙短褲Look，大方展示修長的「長腿」、纖細的「A4 腰」及「美人肩」，畫面極度吸睛。令人驚喜的是，其中一套戰衣竟由成員莊子璇（Hilary）親自操刀設計，將自己的構思成功變為現實的舞台服裝，展現出她除了演藝才華外的另一面。</p><p>莊子璇親解設計理念「本身諗住着一兩次」</p><p>Hilary對於自己的設計被選用於正式MV中感到非常開心，她接受官方訪問時坦言：「今次好開心用咗我設計嗰套衫，因為我本身諗住大家可能着一、兩次，已經冇機會再着，可能大家都好鍾意呢套衫，所以就用咗喺 MV 裏面。」Hilary進一步透露，她的設計以「黑、白、銀」三種色調為主，認為在純白色的背景下拍攝，更能突顯出這系列服裝的型格與時尚感。</p><p>新歌MV大晒長腿A4腰 成員造型超性感</p><p>MYNT首支派台歌《Turn My Magic On》MV今日（19日）強勢首播，六位成員宋宛穎（Sabrina）、倪嘉雯（Carmen）、莊子璇（Hilary）、倪樂琳（Ellyn）、喬美莎（Chelsea）及盧映彤（Skylar）均以大膽前衛的視覺形象示人。除了Hilary設計的服裝外，MV中其他造型同樣性感火辣，配上型格舞步，完美展示出組合「魔力」與「誘人」的一面，視覺效果相當震撼。</p><p>網民熱議莊子璇多才多藝「估唔到佢識設計」</p><p>消息一出，網民紛紛對Hilary的隱藏技能表示驚訝，並大讚她多才多藝。不少留言湧入討論區：「Hilary又靚又有才華，真係港姐冠軍嘅典範！」、「套衫好靚，黑白銀色好有型，完全唔似新人設計。」、「估唔到佢仲識做衫，TVB應該開個節目俾佢發揮下！」、「又要做女團又要設計，會唔會太辛苦？」、「支持Hilary！期待睇到佢更多設計作品！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_4714192946a8569bf40ede.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_4325430866a8569c9bb58d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_3286252956a8569cc277ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_18277221906a8569d4daa83.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_12647249156a8569e13fd09.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_12059324196a8569e41a02c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_20991425216a8569e6c5d7e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_9592246736a8569e8dccd6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_3696847826a8569eaed1bd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10a_3053253146a8569ee4a03e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_4043637906a8569f102eb8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_10248923966a8569f6ece34.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_3771170226a8569fa108fe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_4854681546a8569fc0ed69.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_15685260106a8569fec2a6b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_2368826216a856a0128779.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_15319860226a856a03b1d92.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_11191659766a856a066d11d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_13589369806a856a10a8f19.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_17865977836a856a18947da.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_20913176036a856a1f56607.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_18641773696a856a24e35bf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_16591847516a856a273dc05.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_14363258106a856a3428fea.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_2336422426a856a3b0a3e9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_21318166836a856a3da0243.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_19281388396a856a4763193.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_3148069096a856a4f32330.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_11074254266a856a59b0398.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_13236777136a856a5f6deb9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_2079496336a856a6d4ac11.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_15276349776a856a763e108.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_9768408506a856ac330477.jpeg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T08:47:12.801528+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1195,"images":33,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}